RusturfTunnel_Text_DevonGruntIntro::
	.string "You followed me all the way here?\n"
	.string "TEAM AQUA needs these parts.\p"
	.string "Stay back! The bird and the goods\n"
	.string "are coming with me!$"

RusturfTunnel_Text_DevonGruntDefeat::
	.string "Beaten, in a tunnel, by you…\n"
	.string "Some escape plan!$"

RusturfTunnel_Text_ReceivedDevonGoods::
	.string "{PLAYER} recovered\n"
	.string "the DEVON GOODS!$"

RusturfTunnel_Text_DevonGruntLeaves::
	.string "Fine! Take the parts and the bird.\n"
	.string "I am getting out of here!$"

RusturfTunnel_Text_DevonGoodsNoRoom::
	.string "I give up! But your BAG cannot\n"
	.string "hold these DEVON GOODS.\p"
	.string "Make room and come back for them.\n"
	.string "I will not battle you again.$"

RusturfTunnel_Text_Peeko::
	.string "PEEKO: Pihyoh!$"

RusturfTunnel_Text_PeekoSafe::
	.string "PEEKO flew back toward MR. BRINEY.\p"
	.string "The DEVON GOODS are safe, too.\n"
	.string "Time to return to RUSTBORO.$"

RusturfTunnel_Text_ReunionWork::
	.string "The passage is clear at last.\nI'm finishing the supports by hand.\p"
	.string "You got the stolen GOODS back.\nThe workers told me all about it!$"

RusturfTunnel_Text_ReunionWanda::
	.string "WANDA: There you are!\nI came through from VERDANTURF.\p"
	.string "You kept the noisy machines away\nso the wild POKéMON could rest.$"

RusturfTunnel_Text_ReunionPartner::
	.string "We can visit RUSTBORO together now.\nNo more long journey around!$"

RusturfTunnel_Text_ReunionHome::
	.string "WANDA: Thank you for helping\neveryone here. We'll head home.\p"
	.string "Come visit us in VERDANTURF!$"
